<title>USA: Serologicals sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Serologicals sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Serologicals Corp said its board has approved a three-for-two stock split of its common stock to be distributed in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend on February 28, record February 10.</p>
<p>Following the distribution of the additional shares, Serologicals will have a total of 14.2 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
